<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson, Volvo in China deal.</title>
<headline>Ericsson, Volvo in China deal.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecommunications firm AB LM Ericsson said on Monday that with vehicle maker AB Volvo it had signed a contract with China's Post and Telecommunications Ministry for seven mobile AXE switches.</p>
</text>
